This is a list of Shikinaisha in [[the Imperial Palace]]. That is the shrines in the [[Engishiki Jinmyōchō]] in the province.

The Engishiki Jinmyōchō counts 39 Shikinaisha in the province – 6 Shikinai Shosha and 33 Shikinai Taisha.

