This is the list of Shikinaisha, or [[Shinto shrine]]s in the [[Engishiki Jinmyōchō]] at the beginning covering the shrines in the Imperial Palace of [[Heian-kyō]].
The shrines in this area are very complex. If they have sub parts they are well documented. Shrines in other areas are not well documented.
